@startuml deployment
title BasilCare AI - deployment (scope sections 4 and 6)
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 50

node "Raspberry Pi 4 B (8 GB)\nRaspberry Pi OS 64-bit" as Pi {
  component "basilcare_edge\n(systemd service)" as Edge
  database "SQLite outbox\n+ images" as Outbox
  component "TFLite model\n(int8, LiteRT)" as Model
  Edge --> Outbox
  Edge --> Model
}
node "Sensors, camera,\nrelay + pump" as HW
HW -- Pi : I2C, 1-Wire, GPIO, CSI

cloud "Cloud IaaS VM (Docker Compose)" as VM {
  node "Reverse proxy\n(TLS 443)" as Proxy
  node "Mosquitto 2.0\n(TLS 8883, ACL,\npersistence)" as Broker
  node "Node-RED 4.0\ningestion flow" as NodeRed
  node "WildFly 42\n(Jakarta EE 11, Java 25)" as WildFly {
    artifact "iam.war" as IAM
    artifact "api.war" as API
  }
  database "MongoDB 7" as Mongo
  node "ai-service\n(RAG, MCP, LLMOps)\nplanned" as AIS
}

node "Phones / laptops" as Phone {
  artifact "Farmer PWA" as PF
  artifact "Admin PWA" as PA
}

Edge --> Broker : MQTT QoS 1\nbasilcare/v1/{device}/...
Broker --> NodeRed : MQTT, persistent session
NodeRed --> API : HTTP POST /api/ingest/*\nX-Ingest-Key
API --> Broker : MQTT pump/cmd\n(only the API publishes it)
API --> Mongo
IAM --> Mongo
API ..> IAM : JWKS (Ed25519 public keys)
PF --> Proxy : HTTPS
PA --> Proxy : HTTPS
Proxy --> WildFly : /iam, /api
AIS --> API : REST, user's token\n(MCP tools)

note bottom of VM
  Code: git clone, then git pull + deploy/deploy.sh.
  Secrets only in deploy/.env (never committed).
end note
@enduml
